# Firebase
.firebase/
functions/.runtimeconfig.json
# Generated deploy manifest. `firebase deploy` normally discovers the functions
# by booting the bundle on a local port and calling it over HTTP; where that
# call cannot reach the loopback interface (some Windows setups), capturing the
# same manifest to services/functions/functions.yaml makes the CLI read it
# directly instead. It goes stale the moment a trigger changes, so it is never
# committed — see docs/product/tester-readiness-runbook.md.
services/functions/functions.yaml
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log

